## Executing the application

We currently do not support launching the application through a wraper or somthing that requires us to do `execve` or similar system calls. This is because such system calls replace the memory of the process with the new executable, incurring many awkward checks with isolations. However, `fork`s, `clone`s, and other thread-like system calls are supported.

